      "data": {
        "text": "\"Create batch_translate.py in the current working directory.\nTask: translates a list of strings while preserving order.\nUse one concrete external provider and make that provider identifiable in code.\n\"",
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0b98c460e001MV7qKVvC8dpdwO",
      "message_id": "msg_0b98c460a0017MdjwLozBKcN3m",
